  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You are tied strongly to Ezmodun, giving your Cazic-fer form a bull-like appearance. You are often restless in times of complacency or peace, and frequently find a drive to change things which you dislike, no matter what might be in your way. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your Seek attempts to disbelieve illusions and Escape. When you roll a success on these checks, you critically succeed instead.</span></p><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special:</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> If you are using the Golarion Ancestries rule, you can select any Minotaur ancestry feats (at your GM’s discretion).</span></p>"
